Telosnex: keep WebKit's bubblewrap sandbox for a bundled app.
- A classic Snap is unconfined: isInsideSnap() is false there (confinement
  from $SNAP/meta/snap.yaml), so WebKit sandboxes itself.
- WEBKIT_SANDBOX_HELPERS_DIR: folder of the bundled bwrap and
  xdg-dbus-proxy (used when the file is there).
- WEBKIT_SANDBOX_RO_PATHS: colon-separated folders mounted read-only in
  the sandbox (the app's libraries and dynamic linker outside /usr).

